{
    "title": "Lyst: Shop Fashion Brands",
    "description": "Join 200 million shoppers using Lyst to find all the hottest fashion sales. \r\nSee why fashion insiders all over the world are obsessed with this app:\r\n\r\nSHOP ICONIC BRANDS\r\nLyst has the world\u2019s widest and wildest selection of fashion, from luxury designers to breakout brands and streetwear labels. Get hard-to-find pieces from Gucci, Balenciaga, Nike, Jacquemus, Off-White, Essentials, Diesel and thousands more. \r\n\r\nFIND ALL THE HOTTEST FASHION SALES\r\nWe hunt for promotions the minute they go live, so you get notified as soon as your saved items drop in price. Lyst members unlock the best deals; if you\u2019ve liked it, we\u2019ll track it for you. \r\n\r\nGET ESSENTIAL SHOPPING INTELLIGENCE\r\nNew lists and tips hit the app every day, serving the internet\u2019s best kept fashion shopping secrets. Get insider intel on what\u2019s new, what\u2019s hot and what\u2019s about to sell out. Stay on top of the fashion charts with The Lyst 50 and The Lyst Index. \r\n\r\nSPEND WITH CONFIDENCE\r\nIf it\u2019s on Lyst, it\u2019s legit. We only offer new and authentic products and we assess every partner brand and store\u2019s shipping policies to make sure you\u2019ll only have a great experience shopping with us.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Join 200 million shoppers using Lyst to find all the hottest fashion sales. <br>See why fashion insiders all over the world are obsessed with this app:<br><br>SHOP ICONIC BRANDS<br>Lyst has the world\u2019s widest and wildest selection of fashion, from luxury designers to breakout brands and streetwear labels. Get hard-to-find pieces from Gucci, Balenciaga, Nike, Jacquemus, Off-White, Essentials, Diesel and thousands more. <br><br>FIND ALL THE HOTTEST FASHION SALES<br>We hunt for promotions the minute they go live, so you get notified as soon as your saved items drop in price. Lyst members unlock the best deals; if you\u2019ve liked it, we\u2019ll track it for you. <br><br>GET ESSENTIAL SHOPPING INTELLIGENCE<br>New lists and tips hit the app every day, serving the internet\u2019s best kept fashion shopping secrets. Get insider intel on what\u2019s new, what\u2019s hot and what\u2019s about to sell out. Stay on top of the fashion charts with The Lyst 50 and The Lyst Index. <br><br>SPEND WITH CONFIDENCE<br>If it\u2019s on Lyst, it\u2019s legit. We only offer new and authentic products and we assess every partner brand and store\u2019s shipping policies to make sure you\u2019ll only have a great experience shopping with us.",
